# Simulator

The dashboard is the entry point for the available field experiences.

## Create a lobby

Choose **Create New Match** on the [dashboard](/dashboard) to create a FGC 2026 lobby. The dashboard confirms the generated match ID after the API creates the lobby.

Lobby creation establishes the match record used by the game services. It is useful for development and prepares the backend for the multiplayer flow.

## Offline sandbox

Choose **Enter Sandbox (Offline)** to open the local field experience without joining a remote match. This is the best current way to explore the field and simulator controls while the online client flow is still under construction.

## Current limitations

The project is transparent about what remains unfinished:

- entering a match ID in the dashboard does not connect you to a live lobby yet;
- browser WebSocket connection, reconnect behavior, and live game state rendering are still being built;
- the game server and ticket endpoints exist for development, but the browser-facing multiplayer workflow is not a released feature.

> Create and save a robot now, then use the offline sandbox to explore. Follow project updates through [Team Vietnam on Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/TeamVietnamFGC) or [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/teamvietnam.fgc/).
